    },
    {
      "id": "claim_720e52c0b16045759777686046dcce02",
      "statement": "Green-coffee transparency pricing (per-origin, per-kg, USD, not FX-normalized, does not drive search sorting) is kept separate from roasted retail pricing (bean-level, per-bag, local currency, FX-normalized to price_usd, drives sort_by=price and price_large).",
