      "id": "claim_092554a5531943688db83150551e43fd",
      "statement": "price_paid_for_green_coffee (with currency_of_price_paid_for_green_coffee) is a legacy bean-level green-coffee price field predating the per-origin transparency model; it carries no gt=0 or range constraint and survives for backward compatibility, while new scrapers populate the per-origin fields.",
