    {
      "id": "claim_16d680ec5ef94ad68dafba13f17e97fe",
      "statement": "The FX normalization pipeline has three layers: static fallback rates in src/kissaten/database/fx.py used by the PriceOption check_prices validator, the currency_rates DuckDB table populated by update_currency_rates via the kissaten refresh CLI, and the precomputed price_usd column written by calculate_usd_prices for sorting and filtering.",
