      "id": "claim_7ccc0181119b4a1aabbd908b48954446",
      "statement": "The /currencies/update and /currencies/refresh API endpoints are disabled in API mode because kissaten serve opens the production DB read-only; they return HTTP 409 directing operators to run kissaten refresh, which is the only path that writes to currency_rates.",
