      "statement": "convert_price(conn, amount, from_currency, to_currency) performs on-the-fly currency conversion at query time using the latest currency_rates rows, and is used by the bean detail endpoint for display-currency conversion, by /v1/convert, and for converting user min_price/max_price filter bounds into the USD basis used by price_usd.",
