    {
      "id": "claim_19ffb2c8f4124d22871cc9174d8d1972",
      "statement": "The /v1/search sort_by=price maps to sb.price_usd/sb.weight (retail price per gram in USD) and sort_by=price_large maps to the largest-bag per-kg USD price from price_options; neither sort key uses the per-origin transparency prices, so search sorts by retail price, not green-coffee transparency price.",
