      "id": "claim_115d7612a8fb4decaab8c72ffc6ec678",
      "statement": "The AI image extraction endpoint explicitly strips all price fields because an image cannot reliably convey pricing: per-origin fob_price, farm_gate_price, and price_paid_to_producer are set to None, along with bean-level price, price_options, price_paid_for_green_coffee, and currency.",
