      "id": "claim_aeaac3288dbe412fb01f5ca858fc81f1",
      "statement": "The AI extraction prompt instructs the model to only extract transparency prices when explicitly stated on the product page, to keep them between $0.50-$100 USD, and not to confuse them with retail roasted coffee prices, recognizing common phrases like 'FOB price', 'farm gate', and 'price paid to farmer/producer'.",
