      "id": "claim_6b423c46185d4d31b7b18ea8e6d8bd00",
      "statement": "The PriceOption check_prices model validator uses the static fx.rates dict from src/kissaten/database/fx.py to verify that a retail price converts to at most $150 USD equivalent, raising a ValueError if the converted price is negative or exceeds that cap.",
