    {
      "id": "claim_b534ac95e5714e50a97319a7ed55ddcf",
      "statement": "Transparency is per-origin: a blend's origins[] array carries independent pricing for each lot because each origin is sourced through a different supply chain with different farm-gate, FOB, and importer details, making a single bean-level transparency number misleading for multi-origin products.",
